    // the IR does not grow. Only a literal that carries a type (a suffix, or a value
    // past Int) pays for js_ktlit, whose DIGITS travel as text because emitNum would
    // round 9223372036854775807 to 9223372036854776000 on the way into the module - and
    // round it DIFFERENTLY under goja and -frozen, which the matrix demands agree.
