    // Int, Int + Long is a Long, UInt + UInt is a UInt), wrap silently on overflow and
    // throw ArithmeticException on a divide by zero. A Double operand still pulls the
    // whole operation into floating point, so mixed Int/Double arithmetic is unchanged.
    // The twins are jArith / jCmp / kadd in kotlin-interpreter.abnf.
    var coreEmitBinK = emitBin
    var ktArithOp = {"$-": "-", "$-=": "-", "$*": "*", "$*=": "*",
