    // (spec-cited: no kotlinc on this machine). js_scope_new per iteration is that `val`.
    // It costs one allocation and one js_scope_decl per iteration of every for loop;
    // tests/bench/modfor.kt measures it (tests/bench/mod.kt uses a WHILE loop).
    function makeForRange(items) {
