    // The declared RETURN type of the IR function being emitted, "" when it declares
    // none. A lambda emitted inside a typed function resets it (emitFunc saves and
    // restores), so only the function that declared the type retypes its own returns.
    var curRetTy = ""
    // One returned value, retyped by the enclosing function's declared return type.
    // Applied at makeReturn and makeExprBody, so the block form (`fun f(): Long {
